00:00:47.520 --> 00:00:49.280
Take your fucking jacket
off, then.

00:00:51.440 --> 00:00:52.280
Quickly.

00:00:56.720 --> 00:00:57.800
Fuck yeah.

00:01:00.800 --> 00:01:02.960
So, are you guys excited
about going to France?

00:01:03.560 --> 00:01:05.080
Not really.
I get coach sick.

00:01:05.160 --> 00:01:07.520
Oh, I wish I could go.

00:01:07.600 --> 00:01:09.080
