and her dad, so…

00:02:07.120 --> 00:02:09.240
Maybe you can
help each other out.

00:02:12.720 --> 00:02:14.360
Did I say the wrong thing?

00:02:14.440 --> 00:02:15.520
No.

00:02:15.600 --> 00:02:17.120
That's very astute,
